IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `isl-nouns`

-- Income Support Law 5741-1980 (Israel), Chapter 2 (פרק ב׳: זכאות) -- ss 2, 3, 3A, 3C, 4 (s 3B is repealed in this text).  Layer 1: the law, objectively.
--
-- Reading a result.  A MAYBE BOOLEAN: JUST TRUE (the text says yes), JUST FALSE (the text says no in its own words: a flat negative, a closed
-- "means" list, or a failed condition introduced by "as long as", "provided that", "unless", "except"), NOTHING (not covered; the reason is on each branch).
-- A grant that speaks of a class ("a resident who has reached 25", "a pregnant woman") says nothing of anyone outside it: NOTHING.
-- Whatever the Law leaves to regulations or to a judgment of someone else is an input, and where the answer would turn on the regulation itself it is NOTHING.
-- The functions of s 3, 3A and 3C answer JUST TRUE when the person falls in the class that is NOT entitled (the text's flat negative).

§ `Section 2(a)(1) -- no capacity to work, or not placeable in any work`

-- The finding that a person is "not placeable in any work" must be made by one of three bodies, each for one situation: (a) for one treated in an
-- institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order, a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister, or the said institution
-- (המוסד האמור, read as the institution of treatment: fork `institution-of-treatment`); (b) for one under a probation officer's supervision under the Arrests Law, that
-- probation officer; (c) for one staying at an alcoholics treatment centre under the Ministry's supervision, that centre.
-- src:79 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} אין לו הכושר לעבוד ולהתפרנס כדי מחייתו, או שאינו ניתן להשמה בעבודה כלשהי, הכל לפי כללים, תנאים ומבחנים שנקבעו בתקנות ובלבד שהקביעה כי הוא אינו ניתן להשמה בעבודה כלשהי תיעשה בידי אחד מהמפורטים בפסקאות משנה (א) עד (ג) כמפורט בהן, ותהיה לתקופה שלא תעלה על התקופה שקבע השר לענין זה:
-- src:80 | {{ח:תתתת|(א)}} לגבי מי שמטופל במוסד או נמצא בתהליך גמילה מסם לפי צו מבחן של בית המשפט – מרכז לאבחון מתמכרים לסמים שאישר השר או המוסד האמור; לענין זה –
-- src:81 | {{ח:תתתת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”מוסד“, ”סם“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הפיקוח על מוסדות לטיפול במשתמשים בסמים#סעיף 1|בסעיף 1 בחוק הפיקוח}};
-- src:82 | {{ח:תתתת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”צו מבחן“ – כמשמעותו {{ח:חיצוני|חוק העונשין#פרק ו סימן ז|בסימן ז׳ של פרק ו׳ בחוק העונשין}};
-- src:83 | {{ח:תתתת|(ב)}} לגבי מי שמצוי בפיקוחו של קצין מבחן לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)|חוק המעצרים}} – קצין מבחן כאמור;
-- src:84 | {{ח:תתתת|(ג)}} לגבי מי ששוהה במרכז לטיפול באלכוהוליסטים המצוי בפיקוח משרד העבודה והרווחה – המרכז האמור;
@ref s 2(a)(1) (src:79-84)
GIVEN situation IS A `Placement situation`
      `the body that found the person not placeable` IS A Determiner
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(1) the finding of non-placement was made by the body the text names for the situation` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF situation EQUALS `treated in an institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order`
           AND `the body that found the person not placeable` EQUALS `a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister, or the institution in which the person is treated`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF situation EQUALS `under the supervision of a probation officer under the Arrests Law`
           AND `the body that found the person not placeable` EQUALS `a probation officer`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF situation EQUALS `staying at an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry`
           AND `the body that found the person not placeable` EQUALS `an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ובלבד שהקביעה כי הוא אינו ניתן להשמה בעבודה כלשהי תיעשה בידי אחד מהמפורטים בפסקאות משנה (א) עד (ג) כמפורט בהן"

@ref s 2(a)(1) (src:79)
GIVEN `has no capacity to work and to support themselves, judged under the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set` IS A BOOLEAN
      `cannot be placed in any work, judged under the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the finding of non-placement was made by the body the text names for the situation` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the finding is for a period that does not exceed the period the Minister set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(1) the person has no capacity to work or cannot be placed in any work` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `has no capacity to work and to support themselves, judged under the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `cannot be placed in any work, judged under the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set`
           AND `the finding of non-placement was made by the body the text names for the situation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
           AND `the finding is for a period that does not exceed the period the Minister set`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `cannot be placed in any work, judged under the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ובלבד שהקביעה ... תיעשה בידי אחד מהמפורטים ... ותהיה לתקופה שלא תעלה על התקופה שקבע השר לענין זה"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה" -- "אין לו הכושר לעבוד ולהתפרנס כדי מחייתו, או שאינו ניתן להשמה בעבודה כלשהי"

§ `Section 2(a)(2) and (2A)`

-- (2): registered at the employment service as unemployed under the rules fixed for s 163 of the Insurance Law, and the service did not offer
-- suitable work.  "Suitable work" means any work that fits the person's health and physical ability, or training, further training or retraining on a
-- referral from the employment service or whoever it authorised.
-- src:85 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הוא רשום בלשכת שירות התעסוקה כמחוסר עבודה בהתאם לכללים שנקבעו לענין {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#סעיף 163|סעיף 163 לחוק הביטוח}} ולשכת שירות התעסוקה לא הציעה לו עבודה מתאימה; לענין פסקה זו, ”עבודה מתאימה“ – כל עבודה התואמת את מצב בריאותו וכשרו הגופני, או הכשרה, השתלמות או הסבה מקצועית לפי הפניה משירות התעסוקה או ממי שאישר לכך שירות התעסוקה (להלן בסעיף זה – הכשרה);
@ref s 2(a)(2) (src:85)
GIVEN `work that fits the person's state of health and physical ability` IS A BOOLEAN
      `training, further training or retraining on a referral from the employment service or someone it authorised` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(2) the work or training is suitable work` MEANS
    IF `work that fits the person's state of health and physical ability` OR `training, further training or retraining on a referral from the employment service or someone it authorised`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "עבודה מתאימה“ – כל עבודה התואמת את מצב בריאותו וכשרו הגופני, או הכשרה, השתלמות או הסבה מקצועית לפי הפניה משירות התעסוקה או ממי שאישר לכך שירות התעסוקה"

@ref s 2(a)(2) (src:85)
GIVEN `registered at the employment service as unemployed under the rules fixed for s 163 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the employment service offered the person suitable work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(2) the person is registered as unemployed and was offered no suitable work` MEANS
    IF `registered at the employment service as unemployed under the rules fixed for s 163 of the Insurance Law` AND (NOT `the employment service offered the person suitable work`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "הוא רשום בלשכת שירות התעסוקה כמחוסר עבודה ... ולשכת שירות התעסוקה לא הציעה לו עבודה מתאימה"

-- (2A): even if under 25, one to whom paragraphs (7) to (10), (14), (16), (18), (19), (23), (24) or (26) of the First Schedule apply is entitled,
-- as long as that Schedule's conditions are met and by its rules.  The item's own result (from isl-sch1-young) is carried in.
-- src:86 | {{ח:תתת|(2א)}} מתקיים בו האמור {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 7|בפסקאות (7) עד (10)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 14|(14)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 16|(16)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 18|(18)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 19|(19)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 23|(23)}} {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 24|(24)}} {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 26|או (26) בתוספת הראשונה}}, אף אם טרם מלאו לו 25 שנים, כל עוד מתקיימים בו התנאים הקבועים לגביו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת האמורה}}, ולפי הכללים שנקבעו בה;
@ref s 2(a)(2A) (src:86)
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`s 2(a)(2A) the listed items of the First Schedule` MEANS LIST 7, 8, 9, 10, 14, 16, 18, 19, 23, 24, 26

-- The function below takes an item number and that item's result; the list of items is the value above.
@ref s 2(a)(2A) (src:86)
GIVEN `the item of the First Schedule relied on` IS A NUMBER
      `the result for that item` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(2A) the person meets one of the listed items of the First Schedule` MEANS
    IF elem `the item of the First Schedule relied on` `s 2(a)(2A) the listed items of the First Schedule`
    THEN `the result for that item`
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (2A) names items 7 to 10, 14, 16, 18, 19, 23, 24 and 26 and no others

§ `Section 2(a)(3) and (4)`

-- (3): works or is in training, including in a rehabilitation framework under the supervision of a government ministry, the Institute or the
-- Prisoners' Rehabilitation Authority, with an income from it lower than the income at which no benefit is payable under this Law (in s 5(b) terms:
-- the benefit the person would have had with no income), and meets the conditions and tests the regulations set.
-- src:87 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} הוא עובד בעבודה או נמצא בהכשרה, לרבות במסגרת שיקומית בפיקוח משרד ממשלתי, המוסד לביטוח לאומי או הרשות כהגדרתה {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הרשות לשיקום האסיר|בחוק הרשות לשיקום האסיר, התשמ״ג–1983}}, שההכנסה מהן פחותה מההכנסה שבשלה אין לשלם לפי הוראות חוק זה גמלה, ומתקיימים בו התנאים והמבחנים שנקבעו בתקנות;
@ref s 2(a)(3) (src:87)
GIVEN `works, or is in training or a rehabilitation framework as the paragraph describes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the income from the work or training` IS A NUMBER
      `the income at which no benefit is payable under this Law` IS A NUMBER
      `meets the conditions and tests the regulations set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(3) the person works or is in training with a low income` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `works, or is in training or a rehabilitation framework as the paragraph describes`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "הוא עובד בעבודה או נמצא בהכשרה"
        IF `the income from the work or training` AT LEAST `the income at which no benefit is payable under this Law` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "שההכנסה מהן פחותה מההכנסה שבשלה אין לשלם לפי הוראות חוק זה גמלה"
        IF (NOT `meets the conditions and tests the regulations set`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "ומתקיימים בו התנאים והמבחנים שנקבעו בתקנות" -- the regulations are not among the sources
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- (4): has reached retirement age.
-- src:88 | {{ח:תתת|(4)}} הוא הגיע לגיל הפרישה;
@ref s 2(a)(4) (src:88)
GIVEN `has reached retirement age` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(4) the person has reached retirement age` MEANS
    IF `has reached retirement age` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "הוא הגיע לגיל הפרישה"

§ `Section 2(a)(5) -- the parent of a child under two`

-- (5)(a): a parent of a child in his custody and with him who has not yet completed two years; if the child's parents are spouses the entitlement
-- under this paragraph is the mother's, unless the spouses chose the other spouse.
-- src:89 | {{ח:תתת|(5)|(א)}} הוא הורה לילד שבהחזקתו ונמצא עמו וטרם מלאו לו שנתיים, ואם הורי הילד הם בני זוג – תהיה הזכאות לגמלה לפי פסקה זו נתונה לאם, אלא אם כן בחרו בני הזוג כי היא תהיה נתונה לבן הזוג האחר;
@ref s 2(a)(5)(a) (src:89)
GIVEN `a parent of a child in the person's custody and with the person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the child's age in complete months` IS A NUMBER
      `the child's parents are spouses` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the child's mother` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the spouses chose that the entitlement go to the spouse who is not the mother` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(5)(a) the parent of a child under two is entitled` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `a parent of a child in the person's custody and with the person`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is for a parent of a child in his custody and with him
        IF `the child's age in complete months` AT LEAST 24 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is for a child who has not yet completed two years
        IF (NOT `the child's parents are spouses`) THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the person is the child's mother` AND `the spouses chose that the entitlement go to the spouse who is not the mother` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "אלא אם כן בחרו בני הזוג כי היא תהיה נתונה לבן הזוג האחר"
        IF `the person is the child's mother` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the spouses chose that the entitlement go to the spouse who is not the mother` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, an inference from allocation: marginal reading): "תהיה הזכאות לגמלה לפי פסקה זו נתונה לאם"

-- (5)(b): spouses who chose may go back and change their choice; but if the spouse who is not entitled under (a) is entitled under paragraph (2),
-- they may do so every six months.
-- src:90 | {{ח:תתתת|(ב)}} בחרו בני הזוג כאמור בפסקת משנה (א), הם רשאים לחזור ולשנות את בחירתם, ואולם אם בן הזוג שאינו זכאי לגמלה לפי פסקת משנה (א) זכאי לה לפי פסקה (2), הם יהיו רשאים לעשות כן כל שישה חודשים;
@ref s 2(a)(5)(b) (src:90)
GIVEN `the spouse who is not entitled under (a) is entitled under paragraph (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `complete months since the choice was last made or changed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(5)(b) the spouses may change their choice` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the spouse who is not entitled under (a) is entitled under paragraph (2)`) THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `complete months since the choice was last made or changed` AT LEAST 6 THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "הם יהיו רשאים לעשות כן כל שישה חודשים" -- a permission limited by a stated period; the text does not say they may not earlier

-- (5)(c): after notice of a choice under (a) or (b), the entitlement takes effect on the first of the next month.
-- src:91 | {{ח:תתתת|(ג)}} תוקפה של זכאות לאחר מסירת הודעה על בחירה כאמור בפסקת משנה (א) או (ב) הוא מ־1 בחודש שלאחר מכן;
@ref s 2(a)(5)(c) (src:91)
GIVEN `the day notice of the choice was given` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 2(a)(5)(c) the day the choice takes effect` MEANS
    Date 1 (DATE_MONTH `the day notice of the choice was given` PLUS 1) (DATE_YEAR `the day notice of the choice was given`)

§ `Section 2(a)(7) to (9)`

-- (7): his main time is devoted to caring for his sick spouse or child who need constant supervision, all by rules, conditions and tests in regulations.
-- src:93 | {{ח:תתת|(7)}} עיקר זמנו מוקדש לטיפול בבן זוגו החולה או בילדו החולה הזקוקים להשגחה תמידית, הכל לפי כללים, תנאים ומבחנים שנקבעו בתקנות;
@ref s 2(a)(7) (src:93)
GIVEN `main time is devoted to caring for a sick spouse or child who needs constant supervision` IS A BOOLEAN
      `meets the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(7) the person's main time goes to caring for a sick spouse or child` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `main time is devoted to caring for a sick spouse or child who needs constant supervision`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "עיקר זמנו מוקדש לטיפול בבן זוגו החולה או בילדו החולה הזקוקים להשגחה תמידית"
        IF (NOT `meets the rules, conditions and tests the regulations set`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "הכל לפי כללים, תנאים ומבחנים שנקבעו בתקנות" -- the regulations are not among the sources
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- (8): a person who performs community service under sub-chapter B1 of chapter 6 of the Penal Law.
-- src:94 | {{ח:תתת|(8)}} הוא עובד שירות בעבודה ציבורית לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק העונשין#פרק ו סימן ב1|סימן ב׳1 לפרק ו׳ של חוק העונשין, התשל״ז–1977}};
@ref s 2(a)(8) (src:94)
GIVEN `serves community service under sub-chapter B1 of chapter 6 of the Penal Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(8) the person performs community service` MEANS
    IF `serves community service under sub-chapter B1 of chapter 6 of the Penal Law` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "הוא עובד שירות בעבודה ציבורית לפי סימן ב׳1 לפרק ו׳ של חוק העונשין"

-- (9): she stays in a shelter for battered women, with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of Welfare, for more than 30 days.
-- Three failures, three answers (marginal readings, see NOTES "Same words, different kind"): not a woman is NOTHING (the paragraph says "she"); no approved stay in a
-- shelter is the text's no under lawyer reading (a), because this paragraph is a limb of the "as long as one of these conditions holds" list of s 2(a); a stay of 30 days
-- or fewer is NOTHING, because "a period exceeding 30 days" is a stated period that limits the paragraph in its own wording (lawyer reading (b)) and she may yet pass it.
-- Its twin, First Schedule item 26, answers NOTHING for the second failure too, because a Schedule item is a class description reached through (2A) and (d)(2), not a limb
-- of the s 2(a) list.  So s 2(a) answers NOTHING, not a no, when this paragraph is the only limb that does not hold and she has stayed 30 days or fewer.
-- src:95 | {{ח:תתת|(9)}} היא שוהה במקלט לנשים מוכות באישור המחלקה לשירותים חברתיים או משרד הרווחה והשירותים החברתיים תקופה העולה על 30 ימים; לעניין זה, ”אישור“, ”מחלקה לשירותים חברתיים“ ו”מקלט לנשים מוכות“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק עבודת נשים#סעיף 7|בסעיף 7(ג)(5) לחוק עבודת נשים, התשי״ד–1954}}.
@ref s 2(a)(9) (src:95)
GIVEN `a woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `stays in a shelter for battered women with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of Welfare` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days of the stay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(9) the woman stays in a shelter for battered women` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `a woman`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph says "היא" (she)
        IF (NOT `stays in a shelter for battered women with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of Welfare`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "היא שוהה במקלט לנשים מוכות באישור המחלקה לשירותים חברתיים או משרד הרווחה והשירותים החברתיים"
        IF `days of the stay` GREATER THAN 30 THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording, lawyer reading (b)): "תקופה העולה על 30 ימים" -- a stated period; a stay of 30 days or fewer is outside it

§ `Section 2(a), (b) and (c) -- the resident of 25 or over`

-- (a): a resident of Israel aged 25 or over is entitled, subject to the provisions of this Law, as long as one of the conditions in paragraphs (1)
-- to (9) holds (paragraph (6) is repealed).  The results of the paragraphs come in as a list.
-- The "no" below needs every limb to say no.  A limb that answers NOTHING keeps this answer NOTHING; in particular (9) answers NOTHING for a stay of 30 days or fewer
-- (a stated period she may yet pass), so a woman at day 20 of a stay whose other limbs all fail is not told "no" here.
-- src:78 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תושב ישראל שמלאו לו 25 שנים זכאי לגימלה, בכפוף להוראות חוק זה, כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה:
@ref s 2(a) (src:78)
GIVEN `a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `the results of paragraphs (1) to (5) and (7) to (9)` IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a) the resident aged 25 or over is entitled under subsection (a)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `a resident of Israel`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection is for a resident of Israel
        IF `age in completed years` LESS THAN 25 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection is for one who has reached 25
        IF any (GIVEN r YIELD r EQUALS JUST TRUE) `the results of paragraphs (1) to (5) and (7) to (9)` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF all (GIVEN r YIELD r EQUALS JUST FALSE) `the results of paragraphs (1) to (5) and (7) to (9)` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה" -- none of them holds
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): a paragraph is not settled by the facts given (a regulation is needed)

-- (b): an additional condition: the claimant was a resident of Israel for 24 consecutive months before filing the claim; it does not apply to one who
-- receives a pension under chapter 5 or chapter 11 of the Insurance Law.
-- src:96 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} תנאי נוסף לזכאות לגימלה הוא שהתובע היה תושב ישראל עשרים וארבעה חדשים רצופים לפני הגשת תביעתו, אולם תנאי זה לא יחול על מי שמקבל קיצבה לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק ה|פרק ה׳}} או {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק יא|פרק י״א לחוק הביטוח}}.
@ref s 2(b) (src:96)
GIVEN `complete consecutive months as a resident of Israel before the claim was filed` IS A NUMBER
      `receives a pension under chapter 5 or chapter 11 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(b) the additional condition of 24 months of residence is met` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `receives a pension under chapter 5 or chapter 11 of the Insurance Law` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says the condition does not apply: "תנאי זה לא יחול על מי שמקבל קיצבה לפי פרק ה׳ או פרק י״א לחוק הביטוח"
        IF `complete consecutive months as a resident of Israel before the claim was filed` AT LEAST 24 THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "תנאי נוסף לזכאות לגימלה הוא שהתובע היה תושב ישראל עשרים וארבעה חדשים רצופים לפני הגשת תביעתו"

-- (a) and (b) together: entitled under (a) and the additional condition of (b) is met.
-- src:78 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תושב ישראל שמלאו לו 25 שנים זכאי לגימלה, בכפוף להוראות חוק זה, כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה:
@ref s 2(a)-(b) (src:78)
GIVEN `the result under subsection (a)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the result under subsection (b)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a) and (b) the resident aged 25 or over is entitled` MEANS `helper both` `the result under subsection (a)` `the result under subsection (b)`

-- (c): the Minister may set by regulations rules and tests for entitlement of a resident aged 25 or over who does not meet the conditions of (a) and (b).
-- src:97 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} השר רשאי לקבוע בתקנות כללים ומבחנים לזכאות לגימלה לתושב ישראל שמלאו לו 25 שנים ושאין מתקיימים בו התנאים האמורים בסעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב).
@ref s 2(c) (src:97)
GIVEN `the person meets the rules and tests the Minister set under s 2(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(c) the person is entitled under the Minister's rules` MEANS
    IF `the person meets the rules and tests the Minister set under s 2(c)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the Minister's rules are not among the sources

§ `Section 2(d) and (e) -- under 25`

-- (d)(1): a child who is a resident of Israel and meets paragraph (1) of the First Schedule is entitled even if (a) and (b) are not met, subject to
-- this Law, as long as the conditions of that paragraph hold.  The item 1 result is carried in.
-- src:98 | {{ח:תת|(ד)|(1)}} ילד תושב ישראל שמתקיים בו האמור {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 1|בפסקה (1) של התוספת הראשונה}}, זכאי לגמלה, אף אם אין מתקיים בו האמור בסעיפים קטנים (א) ו־(ב), בכפוף להוראות חוק זה, כל עוד מתקיימים בו התנאים {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 1|שבפסקה (1) האמורה}}, ולפי הכללים שנקבעו בה.
@ref s 2(d)(1) (src:98)
GIVEN `a child who is a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the result for item 1 of the First Schedule` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(d)(1) the child who is a resident is entitled under item 1 of the First Schedule` MEANS
    IF `a child who is a resident of Israel` THEN `the result for item 1 of the First Schedule` ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is for a child who is a resident of Israel

-- (d)(2): a resident of Israel to whom paragraphs (2) onward of the First Schedule apply, and who would have been entitled had he been 25, is entitled
-- though under 25, as long as the Schedule's conditions are met.
-- src:99 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} תושב ישראל שמתקיים בו האמור {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 2|בפסקאות (2) ואילך של התוספת הראשונה}}, ושאילו מלאו לו 25 שנים היה זכאי לגמלה, זכאי לגמלה אף אם טרם מלאו לו 25 שנים, כל עוד מתקיימים בו התנאים הנקובים לגביו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת הראשונה}}, לפי הכללים שנקבעו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת האמורה}}.
@ref s 2(d)(2) (src:99)
GIVEN `a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the result for the item of the First Schedule from item 2 onward` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `would have been entitled had he been 25` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(d)(2) the resident is entitled under an item of the First Schedule from item 2 onward` MEANS
    IF `a resident of Israel` THEN `helper both` `the result for the item of the First Schedule from item 2 onward` `would have been entitled had he been 25` ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is for a resident of Israel

-- (2A) and (d)(2) overlap for the items (7) to (10), (14), (16), (18), (19), (23), (24) and (26) of the First Schedule.  A resident who meets one of them is entitled
-- under (2A) "even if not yet 25", with no further test; (d)(2) reaches the same items (they are "from item 2 onward") but adds "had he been 25 he would have been
-- entitled".  Either route is enough (fork `2a2a-and-d2-either-route`).  The two routes are joined with `helper either`: a JUST TRUE from either is JUST TRUE; both
-- JUST FALSE is JUST FALSE; anything else is NOTHING.  For an item not on the (2A) list, or item 1, only the (d)(2) route is open.  Each route's own words
-- limit it (a resident of Israel; the Schedule's conditions), so a case outside them is NOTHING in that route, not a no.
-- src:86 | {{ח:תתת|(2א)}} מתקיים בו האמור {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 7|בפסקאות (7) עד (10)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 14|(14)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 16|(16)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 18|(18)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 19|(19)}}, {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 23|(23)}} {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 24|(24)}} {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 26|או (26) בתוספת הראשונה}}, אף אם טרם מלאו לו 25 שנים, כל עוד מתקיימים בו התנאים הקבועים לגביו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת האמורה}}, ולפי הכללים שנקבעו בה;
-- src:99 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} תושב ישראל שמתקיים בו האמור {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 2|בפסקאות (2) ואילך של התוספת הראשונה}}, ושאילו מלאו לו 25 שנים היה זכאי לגמלה, זכאי לגמלה אף אם טרם מלאו לו 25 שנים, כל עוד מתקיימים בו התנאים הנקובים לגביו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת הראשונה}}, לפי הכללים שנקבעו {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1|בתוספת האמורה}}.
@ref s 2(a)(2A) and s 2(d)(2) (src:86-99)
GIVEN `a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the item of the First Schedule relied on` IS A NUMBER
      `the result for that item` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `would have been entitled had he been 25` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(a)(2A) or (d)(2) the resident is entitled under an item of the First Schedule` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the item of the First Schedule relied on` LESS THAN 2 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): (2A) and (d)(2) are for items from item 2 onward; item 1 is s 2(d)(1)
        IF elem `the item of the First Schedule relied on` `s 2(a)(2A) the listed items of the First Schedule` THEN `helper either` viaParagraph2A viaSubsectionD2   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)) only when both routes say no; NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording | silent) otherwise, as in the two routes
        OTHERWISE viaSubsectionD2   -- an item not on the (2A) list is reached by (d)(2) alone, and its answers are those of `s 2(d)(2)`
    WHERE
        viaParagraph2A MEANS IF `a resident of Israel` THEN `s 2(a)(2A) the person meets one of the listed items of the First Schedule` `the item of the First Schedule relied on` `the result for that item` ELSE NOTHING
        viaSubsectionD2 MEANS `s 2(d)(2) the resident is entitled under an item of the First Schedule from item 2 onward` `a resident of Israel` `the result for that item` `would have been entitled had he been 25`

-- (e): the Ministers will fix rules for a resident aged 20 to under 25 who (1) would have been entitled at 25 and (2) proved, in the manner and on the
-- conditions the Ministers fixed, to the satisfaction of the person they appointed, that he did all he could to enter work that fits his health and
-- physical ability.  The rate: s 5(e)(3).
-- src:100 | {{ח:תת|(ה)}} השר, שר המשפטים ושר האוצר כאחד (בסעיף קטן זה – השרים) יקבעו כללים ומבחנים לזכאות לגמלה לתושב ישראל שמלאו לו 20 שנים אך טרם מלאו לו 25 שנים, ושמתקיימים בו שניים אלה:
-- src:101 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} אילו מלאו לו 25 שנים היה זכאי לגמלה;
-- src:102 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הוא הוכיח באופן ובתנאים שקבעו השרים, להנחת דעתו של מי שקבעו לענין זה, כי עשה כל שביכולתו כדי להשתלב בעבודה התואמת את מצב בריאותו וכושרו הגופני.
@ref s 2(e) (src:100-102)
GIVEN `a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `would have been entitled had he been 25` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `proved to the appointed person's satisfaction, in the manner the Ministers fixed, that he did all he could to enter work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2(e) the resident aged 20 to under 25 meets the two conditions` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `a resident of Israel`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection is for a resident of Israel
        IF `age in completed years` LESS THAN 20 OR `age in completed years` AT LEAST 25 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection is for one who has reached 20 and not yet 25
        IF `would have been entitled had he been 25` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words, lawyer reading (a)): "ושמתקיימים בו שניים אלה: (1) אילו מלאו לו 25 שנים היה זכאי לגמלה"
        IF (NOT `proved to the appointed person's satisfaction, in the manner the Ministers fixed, that he did all he could to enter work`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the manner, the conditions and the appointed person are fixed by the Ministers, outside the sources
        OTHERWISE `would have been entitled had he been 25`

-- Entitlement under s 2 by any route.  The (d)(2) input is the result of `s 2(a)(2A) or (d)(2) the resident is entitled under an item of the First Schedule`, which joins (2A) and (d)(2).  JUST TRUE if any route says yes.  Otherwise NOTHING: s 2(c) (the Minister's rules for a resident aged 25 or over)
-- and s 2(e)/(5)(e)(2)-(3) leave routes to regulations, so the text does not itself say there is no entitlement.
-- src:78 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תושב ישראל שמלאו לו 25 שנים זכאי לגימלה, בכפוף להוראות חוק זה, כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה:
@ref s 2 (src:78)
GIVEN `by subsection (a) and (b)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `by subsection (c)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `by subsection (d)(1)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `by subsection (d)(2) or paragraph (2A)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `by subsection (e)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2 the person is entitled by some route` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN r YIELD r EQUALS JUST TRUE) (LIST `by subsection (a) and (b)`, `by subsection (c)`, `by subsection (d)(1)`, `by subsection (d)(2) or paragraph (2A)`, `by subsection (e)`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): s 2(c) leaves further routes to the Minister's regulations, so no route settled does not mean the text says no

§ `Section 3 -- who is not entitled`

-- s 3(1): a person kept in an institution whose whole upkeep is at the expense of the State treasury, the Jewish Agency for Israel, a local authority, or another
-- body set by regulations, is not entitled.
-- src:105 | {{ח:ת}} לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה לפי חוק זה –
-- src:106 | {{ח:תת|(1)}} אדם הנמצא במוסד וכל החזקתו היא על חשבון אוצר המדינה, הסוכנות היהודית לארץ ישראל, רשות מקומית או גוף אחר שנקבע בתקנות;
@ref s 3(1) (src:105-106)
GIVEN `in an institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `whole upkeep is at the expense of the State treasury, the Jewish Agency for Israel or a local authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `whole upkeep is at the expense of another body the regulations set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3(1) the person kept in an institution at public expense is not entitled` MEANS
    IF `in an institution` AND (`whole upkeep is at the expense of the State treasury, the Jewish Agency for Israel or a local authority` OR `whole upkeep is at the expense of another body the regulations set`)
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה לפי חוק זה"
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- s 3(2): a man serving regular service in the Israel Defence Forces, and his wife, are not entitled.
-- src:107 | {{ח:תת|(2)}} אדם המשרת שירות סדיר בצבא־הגנה לישראל ואשתו;
@ref s 3(2) (src:107)
GIVEN `serves regular service in the Israel Defence Forces` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the wife of a person serving regular service in the Israel Defence Forces` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3(2) the soldier in regular service and his wife are not entitled` MEANS
    IF `serves regular service in the Israel Defence Forces` OR `the wife of a person serving regular service in the Israel Defence Forces`
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה לפי חוק זה"
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- s 3(3): a member of a body corporate responsible for the livelihood of its members is not entitled.
-- src:108 | {{ח:תת|(3)}} חבר בתאגיד האחראי לכלכלת חבריו;
@ref s 3(3) (src:108)
GIVEN `a member of a body corporate responsible for the livelihood of its members` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3(3) the member of a body corporate responsible for its members' livelihood is not entitled` MEANS
    IF `a member of a body corporate responsible for the livelihood of its members` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה"; NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- s 3(4): a student at an institution the Minister set by regulations, on the conditions he set, is not entitled, except (a) one paid under s 2(a)(4)
-- (retirement age), (b)(1) an independent parent paid for at least 16 of the 20 months before he began to study there, provided he is not on a programme leading to a
-- second or third academic degree; such a parent is paid for at most 36 months, but the Minister may set conditions for a longer period.
-- src:109 | {{ח:תת|(4)}} תלמיד הלומד במוסד שקבע השר בתקנות ובתנאים שקבע, למעט –
-- src:110 | {{ח:תתת|(א)}} מי שמשתלמת לו גמלה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|פסקה (4) של סעיף 2(א)}};
-- src:111 | {{ח:תתת|(ב)|(1)}} הורה עצמאי, שהשתלמה לו גמלה בעד 16 חודשים לפחות מתוך 20 החודשים שקדמו לחודש שבו החל להיות תלמיד במוסד כאמור, ובלבד שהוא אינו לומד בתכנית לימודים המקנה תואר אקדמי שני או שלישי; גמלה להורה עצמאי שמתקיימות לגביו הוראות פסקת משנה זו תשולם בעד תקופה שלא תעלה על 36 חודשים, ואולם השר רשאי לקבוע תנאים שבהתקיימם תשולם להורה עצמאי כאמור גמלה בעד תקופה ארוכה יותר;
-- src:112 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} אין בהוראות פסקת משנה (1) כדי לגרוע מהאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)}}, ואולם השר רשאי לקבוע הוראות וכללים למתן הקלות לעניין התנאים הקבועים לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|סעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)}} להורה עצמאי שמתקיימות לגביו הוראות פסקת משנה (1).
@ref s 3(4) (src:109-112)
GIVEN `a student at an institution the Minister set by regulations, on the conditions he set` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid a benefit under s 2(a)(4)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an independent parent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `months of benefit paid in the 20 months before he began to study` IS A NUMBER
      `studying on a programme leading to a second or third academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN
      `months of benefit already paid under this exception` IS A NUMBER
      `the Minister set conditions for a longer period and they are met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3(4) the student is not entitled` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `a student at an institution the Minister set by regulations, on the conditions he set`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `paid a benefit under s 2(a)(4)` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "למעט מי שמשתלמת לו גמלה לפי פסקה (4) של סעיף 2(א)"
        IF `an independent parent` AND `months of benefit paid in the 20 months before he began to study` AT LEAST 16 AND (NOT `studying on a programme leading to a second or third academic degree`)
           AND (`months of benefit already paid under this exception` LESS THAN 36 OR `the Minister set conditions for a longer period and they are met`)
        THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "למעט ... הורה עצמאי, שהשתלמה לו גמלה בעד 16 חודשים לפחות מתוך 20 החודשים שקדמו ... ובלבד שהוא אינו לומד בתכנית לימודים המקנה תואר אקדמי שני או שלישי"
        IF `an independent parent` AND `months of benefit paid in the 20 months before he began to study` AT LEAST 16 AND (NOT `studying on a programme leading to a second or third academic degree`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "תשולם בעד תקופה שלא תעלה על 36 חודשים" -- the period has run out; the text does not say what then
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה ... תלמיד הלומד במוסד שקבע השר"

-- s 3(4)(b)(2): subparagraph (1) does not derogate from s 2(a)(2) or (3); the Minister may set easements on the s 2(a)(2)/(3) conditions for such a parent.
-- src:112 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} אין בהוראות פסקת משנה (1) כדי לגרוע מהאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)}}, ואולם השר רשאי לקבוע הוראות וכללים למתן הקלות לעניין התנאים הקבועים לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|סעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)}} להורה עצמאי שמתקיימות לגביו הוראות פסקת משנה (1).
@ref s 3(4)(b)(2) (src:112)
GIVEN `an independent parent within s 3(4)(b)(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `meets s 2(a)(2) or (3)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3(4)(b)(2) subparagraph (1) does not take away an entitlement under s 2(a)(2) or (3)` MEANS
    IF `an independent parent within s 3(4)(b)(1)` AND `meets s 2(a)(2) or (3)`
    THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says in its own words: "אין בהוראות פסקת משנה (1) כדי לגרוע מהאמור בסעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)"
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- s 3 together: if any of the four classes holds the person is not entitled; otherwise the text does not say.
-- src:105 | {{ח:ת}} לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה לפי חוק זה –
@ref s 3 (src:105)
GIVEN `the results of s 3(1) to (4)` IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3 the person is not entitled` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN r YIELD r EQUALS JUST TRUE) `the results of s 3(1) to (4)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיו זכאים"; NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a person outside the four classes is not barred by s 3, which says nothing of him

§ `Section 3A -- refusing suitable work`

-- s 3A: one whose entitlement depends on s 2(a)(2), to whom the employment service offered suitable work and who refused it, is not entitled for the calendar
-- month of the refusal and the month after it.
-- src:115 | {{ח:ת}} מי שזכאותו לגמלה מותנית בקיום האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(2)}}, ולשכת שירות התעסוקה הציעה לו עבודה מתאימה והוא סירב לקבלה, לא יהיה זכאי לגמלה בעד החודש הקלנדרי שבו חל הסירוב האמור ובעד החודש שלאחריו.
@ref s 3A (src:115)
GIVEN `entitlement depends on s 2(a)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the employment service offered suitable work and the person refused it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `calendar months since the month of the refusal` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3A the person who refused suitable work is not entitled for the month` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`entitlement depends on s 2(a)(2)` AND `the employment service offered suitable work and the person refused it`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `calendar months since the month of the refusal` EQUALS 0 OR `calendar months since the month of the refusal` EQUALS 1 THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיה זכאי לגמלה בעד החודש הקלנדרי שבו חל הסירוב האמור ובעד החודש שלאחריו"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the exclusion is for the month of the refusal and the month after it

§ `Section 3C -- a conviction for terrorist murder`

-- s 3C(a): one sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances (a) is not entitled to the benefit; (b) is not counted as a spouse
-- for the benefit, save for s 11; and (c) his spouse is not an independent parent.
-- src:121 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} מי שנדון למאסר בשל עבירת רצח או ניסיון לרצח בנסיבות טרור לא יהיה זכאי לגמלה המשולמת לפי חוק זה, הוא לא יובא בחשבון כבן זוג לעניין גמלה לפי חוק זה, למעט לעניין {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 11|סעיף 11}}, ובן זוגו לא ייחשב הורה עצמאי לעניין חוק זה.
@ref s 3C(a) (src:121)
GIVEN `sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3C(a) the person is not entitled` MEANS
    IF `sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא יהיה זכאי לגמלה המשולמת לפי חוק זה"; NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

@ref s 3C(a) (src:121)
GIVEN `sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
      `for the purpose of s 11` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3C(a) the person is not counted as a spouse for the benefit` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `for the purpose of s 11` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "הוא לא יובא בחשבון כבן זוג לעניין גמלה לפי חוק זה, למעט לעניין סעיף 11"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "הוא לא יובא בחשבון כבן זוג"

@ref s 3C(a) (src:121)
GIVEN `the spouse was sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3C(a) the spouse is not treated as an independent parent` MEANS
    IF `the spouse was sentenced to imprisonment for murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- the text says no in its own words: "ובן זוגו לא ייחשב הורה עצמאי לעניין חוק זה"; NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- s 3C(b): one released from prison in an exchange of Israeli prisoners or political negotiations after conviction of a security offence and a sentence of at
-- least ten years: subsection (a) applies to him until the end of the sentence imposed.
-- src:122 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} על מי ששוחרר ממאסר במסגרת שחרור שבויים ישראליים או משא ומתן מדיני לאחר שהורשע בעבירת ביטחון ונגזרו עליו עשר שנות מאסר לפחות, יחולו הוראות סעיף קטן (א) עד תום תקופת המאסר שנגזרה עליו.
@ref s 3C(b) (src:122)
GIVEN `released in an exchange of Israeli prisoners or political negotiations after conviction of a security offence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `sentenced to ten years' imprisonment or more` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the sentence imposed has ended` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 3C(b) subsection (a) applies to the person released in an exchange` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`released in an exchange of Israeli prisoners or political negotiations after conviction of a security offence` AND `sentenced to ten years' imprisonment or more`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `the sentence imposed has ended` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "עד תום תקופת המאסר שנגזרה עליו"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- s 3C(c): "security offence" and "murder or attempted murder in terrorist circumstances" are as s 326(c) and (h) of the Insurance Law define them (not among the sources: the
-- facts are asked).
-- src:123 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} בסעיף זה, ”עבירת ביטחון“ ו”עבירת רצח או ניסיון לרצח בנסיבות טרור“ – כהגדרתן {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#סעיף 326|בסעיף 326(ג) ו־(ח) לחוק הביטוח}}, בהתאמה.
@ref s 3C(c) (src:123)
GIVETH A STRING
`s 3C(c) what the two terms mean` MEANS "as defined in s 326(c) and (h) of the Insurance Law respectively -- בסעיף 326(ג) ו־(ח) לחוק הביטוח, בהתאמה"

§ `Section 4 -- spouses`

-- s 4(a): the entitlement of each of two spouses is conditional on the other also meeting the s 2 conditions.  (b): that does not apply to whom the Minister
-- fixed otherwise by regulations, on the conditions he fixed.
-- src:126 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} הזכאות לגימלה של כל אחד מבני זוג מותנית בכך שמתקיימים גם בבן זוגו תנאי הזכאות לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|סעיף 2}}.
-- src:127 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} האמור בסעיף קטן (א) לא יחול על מי שהשר קבע בתקנות, בתנאים שקבע.
@ref s 4(a)-(b) (src:126-127)
GIVEN `the person has a spouse` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the spouse meets the conditions of s 2` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `exempted by the regulations under s 4(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 4 the spouse also meets the conditions of s 2` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the person has a spouse`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the section speaks of spouses
        IF `exempted by the regulations under s 4(b)` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says in its own words: "האמור בסעיף קטן (א) לא יחול על מי שהשר קבע בתקנות"
        IF `the spouse meets the conditions of s 2` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the spouse meets the conditions of s 2` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "הזכאות לגימלה של כל אחד מבני זוג מותנית בכך שמתקיימים גם בבן זוגו תנאי הזכאות לפי סעיף 2"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the spouse's result is itself not settled

§ `Sections 2 to 4 together`

-- The person is entitled to the benefit (subject to the rest of the Law) when s 2 gives a route, no exclusion of s 3, 3A or 3C applies, and s 4's spouse condition
-- holds.  An exclusion that applies is the text's no.  An exclusion function that answers NOTHING means the person is outside that class, so it does not stop the grant.
-- src:78 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תושב ישראל שמלאו לו 25 שנים זכאי לגימלה, בכפוף להוראות חוק זה, כל עוד מתקיים בו אחד מתנאים אלה:
@ref s 2-4 (src:78)
GIVEN `s 2 by some route` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 3 not entitled` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 3A not entitled for the month` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 3C not entitled` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person has a spouse` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 4 the spouse condition` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2 to 4 the claimant is entitled to the benefit` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 3 not entitled` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `s 3A not entitled for the month` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `s 3C not entitled` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "לא יהיו זכאים לגימלה לפי חוק זה"
        IF `the person has a spouse` AND `s 4 the spouse condition` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "מותנית בכך שמתקיימים גם בבן זוגו תנאי הזכאות"
        IF `s 2 by some route` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the person has a spouse` AND `s 4 the spouse condition` EQUALS NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the spouse's entitlement is not settled
        IF `s 2 by some route` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): no route of s 2 is settled by the text alone
